OPTION_TOOLTIP_COMPATIBILITY_SETTINGS = "Compatibility settings are offered to help diagnose and work around various crashes, graphical bugs and performance issues. In most cases disabling these features will decrease performance, introduce hitching and/or decrease visual quality. They are only intended to be disabled if you are having specific issues."
OPTION_TOOLTIP_COMPAT_SETTING_ADV_WORK_SUBMIT = "Allows more complex code paths for submitting work to the GPU. Disabling this may cause less consistent or lower framerate but could help avoid some kinds of crashes for certain hardware, driver and OS combinations. "
OPTION_TOOLTIP_COMPAT_SETTING_CMDLIST_MULTITHREADING = "Allows the game to use multiple CPU threads to render the game. Disabling this will likely greatly reduce framerate, but could work around crashes or visual bugs in some cases. "
OPTION_TOOLTIP_COMPAT_SETTING_DEVICE_MULTITHREADING = "Allows asynchronously creating GPU resources such as textures and shaders. Disabling this will likely introduce hitching but could help work around crashes or visual issues on very old drivers or hardware."
OPTION_TOOLTIP_COMPAT_SETTING_FRAME_OVERLAP = "Allows the CPU to work on 2 frames at once. Disabling this may cause less consistent or lower framerate but could help avoid some kinds of crashes for certain hardware, driver and OS combinations. "
OPTION_TOOLTIP_COMPAT_SETTING_OPTIONAL_GPU_FEATURES = "Allows the use of newer GPU features. When disabled, the game will act as if the GPU only supports the minimum required features. Various graphical features will be disabled and the visual quality of the game will likely be reduced. This may help work around driver bugs or other issues with newer GPU features."
